  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Avrop ramavtal Demo/MR f&#xf6;r strategiskt st&#xf6;d KRDF</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Call-Off framework agreement Demo/HR for strategic support to KRDF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen utg&#xf6;rs av ett avrop fr&#xe5;n ramavtalet f&#xf6;r Demokrati och MR, utan f&#xf6;rnyad konkurrensuts&#xe4;ttning.
Syftet &#xe4;r att bist&#xe5; partnerorganisationen Kakheti Regional Development Foundation, KRDF med att utv&#xe4;rdera sin p&#xe5;g&#xe5;ende strategi samt utveckla en ny strategi.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution consists of a call-off without renewed competition from the framework agreement for Democracy and human rights. The purpose is to facilitate the new partner Kakheti Regional Development Foundation, KRDF with the evaluation of their current strategy and the Development of their new strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
